Maybe I have no choice but to endure it?

00:16:09.803 --> 00:16:13.432
I-I'm not saying that I have a thing for that!

00:16:13.432 --> 00:16:15.017
Ino-<i>sempai</i>?!

00:16:15.017 --> 00:16:17.728
Um... Did you just say "endure"...?

00:16:17.728 --> 00:16:19.062
H-Hemo?!

00:16:19.062 --> 00:16:21.064
I-I-I-It's nothing!

00:16:21.064 --> 00:16:23.859
It's just that it's inconvenient
when I get nervous!

00:16:23.859 --> 00:16:25.319
Oh...

00:16:25.319 --> 00:16:26.486
Um...

00:16:26.486 --> 00:16:29.781
I really like to endure
through things as well...

00:16:29.781 --> 00:16:32.117
There's no need to cover me!

00:16:33.452 --> 00:16:37.372
So you always have to go
whenever you get nervous?

00:16:37.372 --> 00:16:38.749
Yeah...

00:16:38.749 --> 00:16:41.710
I've always been like this.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.545
During class presentations...

00:16:43.545 --> 00:16:45.797
During sports day...

00:16:45.797 --> 00:16:49.051
Special event days like that have been rough...

00:16:49.051 --> 00:16:53.013
Could it be a special ability
or something like that?

00:16:53.013 --> 00:16:54.139
Oh yeah.

00:16:54.139 --> 00:16:57.518
This happened at our last concert, too.

00:16:57.518 --> 00:17:00.354
But didn't you actually wet yourself that day?

00:17:00.354 --> 00:17:02.523
I didn't wet myself at all!

00:17:02.523 --> 00:17:05.776
I was 98% okay!

00:17:05.776 --> 00:17:08.946
So... how about the remaining 2%?

00:17:08.946 --> 00:17:12.491
Gosh, let's not have
this conversation during lunch.

00:17:12.491 --> 00:17:14.826
We need to focus on recording!

00:17:14.826 --> 00:17:16.119
You're right.

00:17:16.119 --> 00:17:19.248
We all ended up having to do a retake...

00:17:20.457 --> 00:17:22.459
Moping around won't do anything.

00:17:22.459 --> 00:17:25.212
Let's think of ways to improve our singing.

00:17:25.212 --> 00:17:27.756
Does anyone have any ideas?

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:33.929
Maybe it's not too late to have
the sound engineer manipulate our singing?!

00:17:33.929 --> 00:17:35.514
Have you no shame?!

00:17:36.932 --> 00:17:38.934
You seem to be in trouble, big sister.

00:17:38.934 --> 00:17:41.061
What?! That voice...

00:17:41.061 --> 00:17:43.063
The trick to singing well...

00:17:43.063 --> 00:17:45.649
Would you all like a lesson from us?

00:17:46.567 --> 00:17:48.443
Cream Anmitsu?!

00:17:51.738 --> 00:17:54.366
So anyway, about how we sing...

00:17:54.366 --> 00:17:57.661
Um, hello? Your super popular
idol sister is here...?

00:17:57.661 --> 00:17:58.787
Yeah, yeah.

00:17:58.787 --> 00:18:02.207
I had a feeling you were here
ever since I saw Miss Riri...

00:18:02.207 --> 00:18:05.919
We're only recording today
because you are all, too, right?

00:18:05.919 --> 00:18:06.628
"25 years old"
We're only recording today
because you are all, too, right?

00:18:06.628 --> 00:18:07.504
"25 years old"

00:18:07.504 --> 00:18:09.423
"25 years old"
She saw right through us.

00:18:09.423 --> 00:18:11.425
Come on, this is getting old.

00:18:11.425 --> 00:18:14.261
How many times do I have to
give the same reaction?!

00:18:14.261 --> 00:18:17.097
Big sister, aren't you a bit strict today?

00:18:17.097 --> 00:18:18.432
Now, now.

00:18:18.432 --> 00:18:20.893
We're helping each other out.

00:18:20.893 --> 00:18:23.770
Let's be nice to each other as idols.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:25.731
And don't forget...

00:18:25.731 --> 00:18:28.525
There aren't many sisters
like you two in the world!

00:18:29.776 --> 00:18:31.236
Hoho...

00:18:31.236 --> 00:18:33.697
Could you not say that with that face?

00:18:33.697 --> 00:18:37.451
What? B-But, you know what I mean...

00:18:37.451 --> 00:18:39.912
The younger sister is a popular idol!

00:18:39.912 --> 00:18:42.372
The older sister is an unpopular idol!

00:18:42.372 --> 00:18:43.916
The older sister chases after
her younger sister.

00:18:43.916 --> 00:18:47.002
And they compete with each other
as they aim to become the top idol!

00:18:47.002 --> 00:18:50.214
It's a classic success story!

00:18:50.214 --> 00:18:53.467
How could I not take advantage
of this profitable setup?!

00:18:53.467 --> 00:18:57.137
My intuition as a producer is speaking to me!

00:18:58.013 --> 00:19:00.599
You're so cool, Hoho!

00:19:00.599 --> 00:19:04.186
Is your producer really okay...?

00:19:04.186 --> 00:19:07.022
No, she's our manager.

00:19:07.022 --> 00:19:09.983
She's not even a producer to begin with.

00:19:09.983 --> 00:19:12.361
Anyway, I'll ask you just for the hell of it.

00:19:12.361 --> 00:19:13.820
What's the trick to singing?

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:15.781
What? O-Oh...

00:19:15.781 --> 00:19:20.327
Like... singing while you
think of your favorite things...?

00:19:20.327 --> 00:19:22.454
Nua, Rua, anything else?

00:19:22.454 --> 00:19:23.497
What?!

00:19:23.497 --> 00:19:24.498
What?

00:19:24.498 --> 00:19:26.083
Don't get me involved.

00:19:26.083 --> 00:19:27.668
I've got nothing.

00:19:27.668 --> 00:19:30.295
I'm a prodigy, you know?

00:19:30.295 --> 00:19:32.172
Let's see...

00:19:32.172 --> 00:19:33.173
"Cough drops"
"Refreshing!"
Here!

00:19:33.173 --> 00:19:37.469
"Cough drops"
"Refreshing!"
Got it. I get that you weren't serious
about giving a lesson.

00:19:37.469 --> 00:19:41.390
But thinking of your favorite thing
may be a good idea.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:43.350
That could get us pumped up!

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.519
Favorite things, huh...?

00:19:47.104 --> 00:19:50.774
Unfortunately, I don't really have
anything like that.

00:19:53.026 --> 00:19:57.948
How are you supposed to choose
what your favorite thing is?

00:19:57.948 --> 00:19:59.783
It's a bit too vague, don't you think?

00:19:59.783 --> 00:20:01.577
Your "favorite thing"?

00:20:01.577 --> 00:20:02.911
So how about you all?

00:20:02.911 --> 00:20:03.745
What?!

00:20:03.745 --> 00:20:08.250
I can't tell if you're serious
or joking around, Roko-<i>sempai</i>!

00:20:09.751 --> 00:20:11.795
All right, break time's over!

00:20:11.795 --> 00:20:13.338
It's time for the retakes!

00:20:13.338 --> 00:20:15.883
You girls better get it right
in one shot this time!

00:20:15.883 --> 00:20:17.050
Yes!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.052
I'm okay...

00:20:19.052 --> 00:20:21.847
I just need to think of
my favorite thing and relax...

00:20:21.847 --> 00:20:24.433
My favorite thing... My favorite thing...

00:20:25.559 --> 00:20:27.519
My favorite thing is...!

00:20:27.519 --> 00:20:29.146
Here we go!

00:20:30.189 --> 00:20:33.066
My favorite thing is...!

00:20:33.066 --> 00:20:35.903
My favorite thing... My favorite...

00:20:35.903 --> 00:20:38.197
All right, here we go.

00:20:38.197 --> 00:20:41.909
Nina's soft, fluffy...

00:20:41.909 --> 00:20:43.952
...and warm...!

00:20:46.955 --> 00:20:48.665
I just love this smell!

00:20:48.665 --> 00:20:50.125
I can't get enough of it!

00:20:52.461 --> 00:20:54.213
I can't take it...!

00:20:55.464 --> 00:20:57.174
The venue's completely packed!

00:20:57.174 --> 00:20:59.551
The day has finally come where the dark energy

00:20:59.551 --> 00:21:01.803
concealed within me will be released!

00:21:05.557 --> 00:21:09.269
My favorite thing...
With Ino-<i>sempai</i>'s tights...

00:21:10.437 --> 00:21:14.358
They just happened to
get mixed up, what can I do?

00:21:14.483 --> 00:21:16.235
"Recording"

00:21:17.611 --> 00:21:19.655
Good job!

00:21:19.655 --> 00:21:20.864
Hemo!

00:21:20.864 --> 00:21:23.825
How did it go? Did you sing well?

00:21:23.825 --> 00:21:26.453
Yes, thanks to you!

00:21:26.453 --> 00:21:29.206
I think we got it this time, too!

00:21:29.206 --> 00:21:31.458
We got to put our feelings into it!

00:21:31.458 --> 00:21:32.751
We sure did!

00:23:13.936 --> 00:23:15.604
What the heck?

00:23:15.604 --> 00:23:17.814
Why do they sound so stuffed up?

00:23:18.023 --> 00:23:20.025
"Retake confirmed!"

00:23:25.405 --> 00:23:30.202
"Preview"
Hey! Next on <i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:23:30.202 --> 00:23:31.203
Tone here!

00:23:31.203 --> 00:23:33.956
Everyone in their underwear was truly
a sight for sore eyes, wasn't it?

00:23:33.956 --> 00:23:37.835
Next time, the members of
Fruit Tart will be making curry.

00:23:37.835 --> 00:23:40.379
Oh, I'd love to try it, too!

00:23:40.379 --> 00:23:43.298
But what?! I don't have
any screen time next time?!

00:23:43.298 --> 00:23:45.008
"Super Awesome Curry!"
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:23:45.008 --> 00:23:47.553
"Super Awesome Curry!"
Episode 8: "Super Awesome Curry!"

00:23:47.553 --> 00:23:50.102
"Super Awesome Curry!"
The next episode is also worth the wait!
